    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/0e34d43456f3deb5e0d5ec77684dab2f.avif?t=1752689609\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is a punk-powered adventure about The HEXES as they travel around Long Den on their first ever tour. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something strange is happening at the location of each venue, colourless voids are disrupting normal life and someone has been kidnapping the local mole population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant world of rebellion, freedom, friendship and growing up without losing your edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Long Den, a visually stunning 2D/3D world oozing with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a whole host of local weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use colour to change the environment and solve puzzles or just ruin someones day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the pigs and make your mark with the graffiti ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master mini games like high-speed downhill racing and crowd rocking bass playing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/0f64ca18976d0a8db7bc88afa54956e6.avif?t=1752689609\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is set to an exciting and atmospheric punk and alternative soundtrack featuring real artists.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/0e34d43456f3deb5e0d5ec77684dab2f.avif?t=1752689609\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is a punk-powered adventure about The HEXES as they travel around Long Den on their first ever tour. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something strange is happening at the location of each venue, colourless voids are disrupting normal life and someone has been kidnapping the local mole population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant world of rebellion, freedom, friendship and growing up without losing your edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Long Den, a visually stunning 2D/3D world oozing with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a whole host of local weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use colour to change the environment and solve puzzles or just ruin someones day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the pigs and make your mark with the graffiti ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master mini games like high-speed downhill racing and crowd rocking bass playing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/0f64ca18976d0a8db7bc88afa54956e6.avif?t=1752689609\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is set to an exciting and atmospheric punk and alternative soundtrack featuring real artists.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "DeTails is a narrative adventure starring Cami, a bass player and color slinging chameleon as she travels with her band The Hexes. Explore a vibrant world bursting with a colorful cast of characters. Master mini-games, fight the man, and learn what it means to grow up without losing your edge!",
